    "name": {
      "value": "Storm Survivor"
    },
    "source": {
      "value": "lowg"
    },
    "description": {
      "value": "Through luck or through skill, you managed to survive a catastrophic maritime disaster, such as a shipwreck or being thrown overboard. You have a keen sense for weather or situations that are similar to the one you escaped.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Strength or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Survival skill and the Weather Lore skill.\n\nYou gain the Forager skill feat."
    },
